  47:Tests/spif_tests/spif_tests.c **** /* Layout inside SPIF_TEST_BLOCK, one sector per test so they cannot overlap. Inside a
  48:Tests/spif_tests/spif_tests.c ****  * sector the low half belongs to the driver and the high half to the reference, so both
  49:Tests/spif_tests/spif_tests.c ****  * directions can be tested without stepping on each other. */
